# Every cited target must EXIST, so claim-dangling-path cannot fire and only the handoff predicate
# can. Two are assembled at run time rather than committed: a `.wav`/`.ppm` is binary by name
# (tools/check/binary-ext.txt) and would drag a rights row into the files step, and a `Build/` path
# would be a case-variant duplicate of `build/` in the repository.
write out/x.wav x
write out/x.ppm x
write Build/gate/dev/runner/toy.report x
# A link indirection to the same build product, so the normalised predicate is proved on a path
# whose spelling names no refused class at all.
symlink x build
